QMK Config

Rows:
B6 (pin 10) goes to number row
other pins in order
F6 (pin A1) goes to home/end row

Columns:
Goes Q -> P
"B5", "B4", "E6", "D7", "F4", "F5", "D3", "D2", "C6", "D4", "D0", "D1"

"B5", "B4", "E6", "D7" - first 4
"F4", "F5" - 1st middle 2
"D3", "D2" - 2nd middle 2
"C6", "D4", "D0", "D1" - rest 4
